<title>USA: Berger Holdings to acquire Real Tool Inc.</title>
<headline>Berger Holdings to acquire Real Tool Inc.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berger Holdings Ltd said it will acquire Real Tool Inc for a combination of cash, restricted common shares and future payments.</p>
<p>The company expects the transaction to be completed on February 7.</p>
<p>Berger Holdings is the parent company of Berger Building Products which is a manufacturer of roof drainage products and vinyl siding.</p>
